<description>&lt;p&gt;Syria and Saudi Arabia signed a defence cooperation deal that includes $403 million in loans while Syrian security forces foiled a Hezbollah-linked plot to attack the Homs oil refinery. Lebanese border guards killed a Syrian woman and injured her child during an interception of a vehicle carrying Syrian migrants. Syrian intelligence dismantled ISIS cells in Aleppo and Manbij, and a Syrian woman was killed by Lebanese army fire at the border. 2,732 battle-related deaths occurred in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiowFBVV95cUxNYkMtRElfOXhLcEJEZU0zSjl3WTA0VUtnVkY0S09QQ1BoRHVadndMZjFJY2hWUVJLZjBfMU5OelBQdkNUd0s0M04weEJzZEFaMHFWVEVmZVAyU0NuTHZQRFFoR2RvWl8yTXFZYnZyMi1LTkJ6ZzAzOEtBUmxPOUxmcDRkZDVOR0QzamtrWE9qdEU2NUw3eTdNa2lUU1FVWmlfSGZB?oc=5&quot;&gt;FDD's Long War Journal&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiWkFVX3lxTFA3WW9DQWFkdmo1S2JTOXd4V3F5R0k3ZG5jcnc3YU1mWU92NEp2eWZjanB0UVFscXhPVnBZZldzVGoyNHFvRlJuV3lfRmduTGNVWkdBWjVhVHI5UQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Yemen Online&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Enab Baladi&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiSEFVX3lxTE1EekN4MmI1dDc3aF9nZS01bnlKYmpJUEpuZ1RrZkZUX01pTnNaeEtPTkVLVlBGVDdSbG92UXYxNVZmYzQ5akpmYQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;سانا&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;L'Orient Today&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The National&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitwFBVV95cUxNM29OUHUzMDkzQTFQZFhjdGdKS1BPbFQtNUdUYjgxRUtjMjF5MWY0dVJBc1Z2dFViam9FZWhU